    LineComment "// A generic function (E-17): a top-level function with named type parameters,"
    Newline "\n"
    LineComment "// each optionally bounded by an interface (E-16). A bound names the methods the"
    Newline "\n"
    LineComment "// parameter's type may call in the body; an unbounded parameter is pass-through"
    Newline "\n"
    LineComment "// only — it may be received, stored, and returned, but its methods are unknown."
    Newline "\n"
    LineComment "// A call resolves each type variable from the argument types (the same Match"
